    "faq_1_q": "How long does shipping take?",
    "faq_1_a": "<p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days. Delivery usually takes 7–15 business days depending on your location, and every order is tracked. See our <a href=\"{{ShippingLink}}\">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>",
    "faq_2_q": "How can I track my order?",
    "faq_2_a": "<p>As soon as your package ships we email you the tracking number. You can also check the status any time on our <a href=\"{{TrackOrderLink}}\">Track your order</a> page.</p>",
    "faq_3_q": "Can I change or cancel my order?",
    "faq_3_a": "<p>Yes, within 12 hours of purchase. Email us at <a href=\"mailto:{{CompanyEmailPlain}}\">{{CompanyEmail}}</a> with your order number and we'll update or cancel it before it ships. After that the order is already on its way, but you can still return it under our <a href=\"{{RefundLink}}\">Refund Policy</a>.</p>",
    "faq_4_q": "What is your return and refund policy?",
    "faq_4_a": "<p>You have 45 days from delivery to return or exchange, even if you simply changed your mind. Full details are in our <a href=\"{{RefundLink}}\">Refund Policy</a>.</p>",
    "faq_5_q": "My item arrived damaged or isn't what I ordered. What now?",
    "faq_5_a": "<p>We're sorry! <a href=\"{{ContactLink}}\">Contact us</a> within 45 days with your order number and a photo, and we'll send a replacement or refund you in full.</p>",
    "faq_6_q": "How can I reach customer support?",
    "faq_6_a": "<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:{{CompanyEmailPlain}}\">{{CompanyEmail}}</a> or use our <a href=\"{{ContactLink}}\">Contact page</a>. We reply within 24 hours on business days.</p>",
